        en: "Morning, the white-villages route: Setenil de las Bodegas, where houses are built directly into the rock (the cave streets Cuevas del Sol), and Zahara de la Sierra above its turquoise reservoir. At dusk, a descent to the sea at Málaga: the Picasso Museum in the city of his birth, the Alcazaba fortress and the Muelle Uno waterfront. Overnight: area Málaga (Huelin) or Camping Torremolinos.",
