        en: "Day 4: Costa Quebrada and Liencres (20 km)",
        de: "Tag 4: Costa Quebrada und Liencres (20 km)",
        it: "Giorno 4: Costa Quebrada e Liencres (20 km)",
        nl: "Dag 4: Costa Quebrada en Liencres (20 km)",
        ru: "День 4: Коста-Кебрада и Льенкрес (20 км)",
